# kprompt-website rules

## Repo

Public Next.js 15 (App Router, Turbopack) + TypeScript + Tailwind + shadcn/radix marketing site + `/docs`. See `AGENTS.md`.

## Locked constraints

- Category: **The AI Runtime for Kubernetes**. Never compare against ChatGPT / generic AI chat tools.
- Honesty: shipped-only claims; label MVP; roadmap = "Building next", not fake dates; never "AI auto-fixes everything."
- Providers / features must match what the product actually ships.

## Style

- App Router conventions; server components by default, `"use client"` only when needed.
- Reuse `src/components` primitives and `src/lib/constants.ts`; do not fork parallel design tokens.
- Preserve SEO surfaces: JSON-LD, OG image routes, `sitemap.ts`, `llms.txt`.
- Tailwind utility classes consistent with neighbors; no inline hardcoded brand colors that break theming.

## Checks

```bash
npm run lint
npm run test
npm run build
```

## Commits

Only commit or open PRs when the user asks.
